scp artifacts/paper.pdf uicgpu:/tmp/paper.pdf
ssh uicgpu 'cd /path/to/nougat && python -m nougat /tmp/paper.pdf -o /tmp/nougat_out'
scp uicgpu:/tmp/nougat_out/paper.mmd extraction/nougat.mmd
```

Expected runtime ~2–3 minutes for a 649 KB paper on a single A100.
